# The max3 plans of examples/max3.pk in Zuse's two-dimensional notation.
# Rows: V = variable number, K = component, S = structure (type).
# run: 3 200 17 => 200
# run: 9 8 7 => 9
P1 max3 | (V,   V,   V)   ⇒ R
      V |  0    1    2      0
      S |  8.0  8.0  8.0    8.0

        | max(V,   V)   ⇒ Z
      V |     0    1      1
      S |     8.0  8.0    8.0

        | max(Z,   V)   ⇒ R
      V |     1    2      0
      S |     8.0  8.0    8.0
END

P2 max  | (V,   V)   ⇒ R
      V |  0    1      0
      S |  8.0  8.0    8.0

        | V   ⇒ Z
      V | 0     1
      S | 8.0   8.0

        | (Z   < V)   → V   ⇒ Z
      V |  1     1      1     1
      S |  8.0   8.0    8.0   8.0

        | Z   ⇒ R
      V | 1     0
      S | 8.0   8.0
END
